  "body": "* Premium swimming pool\r\n* Peaceful bush views, private and not overlooked\r\n* Generous garden with manicured landscaping\r\n* Fully retractable sliding doors for seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Versatile living for multi-generational families\r\n* Solar panels for energy-conscious living\r\n\r\nDiscover a private coastal sanctuary where contemporary elegance meets effortless family living. Expansive windows fill the home with natural light, framing tranquil bush views and creating a beautiful connection to the outdoors. Entertain beside the pool, relax in the garden or bring everyone together in the beautifully appointed kitchen-every setting invites you to enjoy the lifestyle.\r\n\r\n* Modern kitchen \r\n* Double ovens and premium appliances\r\n* Butler's pantry complete with a gas hob\r\n* Large windows enhancing light and outlook throughout\r\n* Electric entrance gate for added privacy and convenience\r\n* Inviting outdoor spaces for entertaining and unwinding\r\n\r\nEnjoy an exceptional family lifestyle close to Long Bay Village, with its cafes, shops and everyday conveniences. Long Bay Beach and scenic walking tracks are within walking distance, offering endless opportunities to explore the coast. Set in a friendly, welcoming neighbourhood and zoned for Long Bay Primary School and Long Bay College, this is a superb place to put down roots.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/EFFN",
